# What the content table builders write (scripts/mods/content-tables.json) is
# stored and checked out with LF on every machine, because every builder writes
# LF. Without this a checkout with core.autocrlf true (One, the Windows runners)
# held these files CRLF, so each rebuild there rewrote every one of them whether
# it changed or not, and a table that pins its inputs by sha256 pinned bytes no
# other checkout has (#3029). tests/test-3029-builder-eol.js holds this list to
# content-tables.json. What ships still goes out as scripts/release/ShippedBytes.ps1
# reads it, whatever the checkout.
game/data/** text eol=lf
game/gamemode.js text eol=lf
game/plugins/thornswood-front.js text eol=lf
docs/systems/** text eol=lf
tests/fixtures/merchant-retrieval-records.json text eol=lf
